21:["$","ol",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":["\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Zero External Runtime Dependencies"}],":\nAll three language packages (",["$","code",null,{"children":"nepali-date-library"}],") MUST maintain zero external dependencies at runtime. Do not add runtime packages."]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":["\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Standardized Cross-Language Semantics"}],":\nThe API surface across Node.js, Python, and PHP is intentionally synchronized. Method names, formatting tokens (e.g. ",["$","code",null,{"children":"YYYY-MM-DD"}],", ",["$","code",null,{"children":"dddd"}],"), fiscal year quarters, and edge case handling should match across all implementations."]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":["\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Annual Calendar Verification & Range Coverage (1976 – 2100 BS)"}],":\nDates up to the current active calendar year are verified against official Government of Nepal publications (Nepal Panchanga Nirnayak Samiti). Every year around the month of ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"Ashwin (Ashoj)"}],", when the official government calendar is released for the upcoming year, the mapping tables are audited and updated with exact solar ingress corrections. Test suites must pass across all supported years (1976/01/01 to 2100/12/31 BS)."]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":["\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Deterministic Timezone Isolation"}],":\nDate arithmetic, weekday getters, and day start/end calculations must execute deterministically regardless of the host machine's local timezone."]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}]
